Dear Vincent,

I am working with GGIR to analyze 24-hour
movement behaviors retrieved from Actigraph GT3X data (7 days, 100 Hz). For
each included participant I make a report with individual details on their
behaviors. However, I noticed some conflicting results when interpreting output of GGIR and the profile of the participant.
I added two examples underneath the script. I was wondering if there is a
explanation for the conflicting results?

g.shell.GGIR(

#=====================

  #
Part 1

#=====================

mode=c(1, 2, 3, 4, 5),

datadir="C:/Users/irwillem/GGIR/Data_OwOb_GT3X",

